# Loft test ship — the owner's Blueprint Loft design, spawned near you via F2.
# 22 x 27 cells at 1x granularity; the game upscales it 8x on spawn so the
# 8-cell-tall player fits through the doors and can board the helm.
# NOTE: no gasbags/blubber, so it has ZERO lift — it will fall. Grapple to it
# (RMB) or add lift blocks in the Loft. Author freely; this is a scratch ship.
